{
  "_doc": "Executable contract for decideRoute(ctx, policy, catalog) in shared/decide-route.js, evaluated against shared/model-catalog.json. EVERY engine that routes (browser extension bundle, desktop enforcer C# port) must pass every case. `policy` is either a key into `policies` or an inline value. `expect` lists the output fields that must match exactly (a field omitted from `expect` is not checked). `label_detection` pins detectTierFromLabel/labelMatches, which the port also needs. Run: npm --prefix browser-extension test (tests/shared-routing.test.mjs).",
